Btw in the AOF file,  line 33, you dont need to hold a mutex if all 
you're doing is File.Sync(), all operations on file can done 
from different goroutines by default
[source of truth](https://pkg.go.dev/os#File)

And instead of using time.Sleep(), you can use a ticker 
ticker := time.NewTicker(1 * time.Second)
go func() {
	defer ticker.Stop()
	for {
		<-ticker.C
		if err := aof.File.Sync(); err != nil {
			log.Println(err)
			return
		}
	}
}()
